<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Santa Fe Energy raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Santa Fe Energy raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer upgraded Santa Fe Energy Resources Inc to buy, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock ended Wednesday at 13-1/4.</p>
</text>
